        {
          "text": " ahakuba akatambira baaruhanga ba Damasikio ebitambo, abaabaire bamusingwire, yaagira ati: Ahabw'okuba baaruhanga b'abagabe ba Siria bakabahwera, naanye niinyija kubatambira ebitambo, babone kumpwera. Kwonka bakaba bari ab'okumucwekyereza hamwe na Israeli yoona. ",
