              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ahazi yaateeranira hamwe ebintu by'omu nju ya Ruhanga, yaabitematemamu ebicweka, yaakinga enyigi z'enju ya MUKAMA, yaayeyombekyera amatambiro buri hantu omuri Yerusaalemu. ",
