          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi omuri buri rurembo rwa Yuda yaakoramu emyanya mikuru y'okuramizamu, kuguma naayoterereramu baaruhanga abandi obubaane, naagwisa kubi MUKAMA Ruhanga wa baishenkuru.",
